OL,3,GNEWSACouncillor loses seat after
OL,4,Asix-month no show
OL,5,
OL,6,FA councillor expelled from Reform UK
OL,7,Ffollowing allegations he made online
OL,8,Fcomments saying he wished to shoot the
OL,9,Fthen Prime Minister Sir Keir Starmer,
OL,10,Fhas lost his seat.
OL,12,FJohn Allen, who represented the Hirst
OL,13,Fward on Northumberland County Council,
OL,14,Fwas kicked out of the party last year
OL,15,Fafter an internal investigation into
OL,16,Fhis conduct.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
