OL,3,GNEWSACouncillor loses seat after
OL,4,Asix-month no show
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe continued on the council without a
OL,7,Fparty affiliation. The authority said
OL,8,FAllen had lost his seat after failing
OL,9,Fto attend a single meeting in the past
OL,10,Fsix months. His details have been
OL,11,Fremoved from the council's website.
OL,13,FA by-election is expected to take place
OL,14,Fby 8 October, the council said. The BBC
OL,15,Fhas been unable to contact Allen.
